     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "In the discussion of the PR we collectively decided to prevent entry of version labels ending  with one or more spaces followed by a number.   So \"version 1\" is invalid while \"version a1\" valid.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Also version labels will be url encoded in http responses.  ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
