  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The following exception is thrown and a stack trace is returned when you create a version with a space in the version name in the web UI:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "com.hp.hpl.jena.shared.InvalidPropertyURIException: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/x1/fcr:versions/version"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/x1/fcr:versions/version",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " 1 ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.hp.hpl.jena.rdf.model.impl.PropertyImpl.checkLocalName(PropertyImpl.java:67)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Full stack trace:  ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://gist.github.com/sprater/87554446460660bf957703f33476449e"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://gist.github.com/sprater/87554446460660bf957703f33476449e",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In addition, the server reports the following warnings and errors:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO 16:11:47.567 (FedoraVersioning) Request to add version 'version 1' for 'x1'",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "WARN 16:11:47.602 (DefaultMessageFactory) MessageFactory event UserData is empty!",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "WARN 16:11:47.648 (DefaultMessageFactory) MessageFactory event UserData is empty!",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "WARN 16:11:47.658 (DefaultMessageFactory) MessageFactory event UserData is empty!",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ERROR 16:11:47.696 (WildcardExceptionMapper) Exception intercepted by WildcardExceptionMapper: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/x1/fcr:versions/version"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/x1/fcr:versions/version",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " 1",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This seems to be display issue, as the same exception is thrown on any subsequent attempt to create a version on the same resource;  the version appears to be created, but the /fcr:versions data cannot be returned and displayed, due to the exception caused when trying to retrieve the version with the space in the name.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Steps to reproduce:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1.  Create a resource (binary or container)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.  Type \"version 1\" in the \"Create version snapshot\" text field",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.  Click \"Create version\" button",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "At this point, the stack trace should be returned.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "4.  Go back with the browser's back button, and attempt to create another version, with any name (or with an auto-generated name)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The stack trace is shown again.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
