     "body": "<p>In the discussion of the PR we collectively decided to prevent entry of version labels ending  with one or more spaces followed by a number.   So \"version 1\" is invalid while \"version a1\" valid.<br/>\nAlso version labels will be url encoded in http responses.  <br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1127\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1127</a></p>",
